msgctxt "3\t195"
msgid ""
"In December of 2005,\\n"
"I lost someone very important to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "226\t301"
msgid "Looking back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316\t432"
msgid ""
"...maybe that was when our fates had\\n"
"been sealed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "605\t721"
msgid ""
"Back when I was still in the Dojima Family\\n"
"⑬a branch of the Tojo Clan⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "737\t861"
msgid ""
"⑬there were only three people in the\\n"
"world that I considered family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "939\t1082"
msgid ""
"My best friend, Akira Nishiki, who grew\\n"
"up in the same orphanage as me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1175\t1381"
msgid "My foster father, Shintaro Fuma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1439\t1654"
msgid ""
"And lastly, Yumi⑬the woman I had\\n"
"loved since childhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1690\t1790"
msgid ""
"Having lost my parents at a young age,\\n"
"these three..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1800\t1914"
msgid ""
"...were the only ones I could really\\n"
"call \"family.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2074\t2099"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2550\t2713"
msgid ""
"What've I done!?\\n"
"He's one of the Tojo Clan's officers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2738\t2904"
msgid ""
"Lying in front of me was the corpse of\\n"
"the patriarch of the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2943\t3110"
msgid "He had tried to force himself on Yumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3120\t3168"
msgid "Snap out of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3204\t3279"
msgid ""
"Nishiki...\\n"
"Take Yumi and get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3294\t3355"
msgid "But... What about you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3408\t3563"
msgid "Just go. And take care of Yumi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3609\t3633"
msgid "Go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3836\t3906"
msgid "I was prepared to do anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3989\t4067"
msgid "...to protect the ones I loved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4169\t4215"
msgid "Start eating!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4301\t4349"
msgid "I was sentenced to ten years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4393\t4509"
msgid ""
"After going inside, I got a letter of\\n"
"expulsion from the Dojima Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4529\t4628"
msgid "...and found out that Yumi had disappeared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4656\t4759"
msgid ""
"I was branded as the traitor who capped\\n"
"his own boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4782\t4932"
msgid ""
"The organization had abandoned me,\\n"
"and I began to slowly retreat into myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4940\t5078"
msgid "But there was one person who never forgot me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5120\t5155"
msgid "Pop..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5208\t5282"
msgid "My foster father, Shintaro Fuma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5330\t5433"
msgid "After my release, I returned to Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5439\t5518"
msgid "I had to see my father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5519\t5699"
msgid ""
"And I also wanted to find out what had\\n"
"happened in the last ten years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5755\t5851"
msgid ""
"But I wasn't prepared for what awaited\\n"
"me there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5875\t6015"
msgid ""
"I have something to ask the Third\\n"
"Chairman in front of everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6056\t6273"
msgid ""
"Is it true that 10 billion yen of the\\n"
"clan's money has been stolen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6334\t6405"
msgid "My former best friend, now changed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6454\t6596"
msgid ""
"...and a group of hardened killers\\n"
"searching for missing money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6730\t6763"
msgid "Pop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6801\t6882"
msgid ""
"There was a sudden struggle to\\n"
"decide the Tojo Clan's successor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6929\t7076"
msgid "And I found myself right in the middle of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7301\t7512"
msgid ""
"I looked for Yumi, taking my father's word\\n"
"that she was connected to the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7527\t7554"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7728\t7775"
msgid "...instead of Yumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7825\t7883"
msgid "...I found a young girl."
msgstr ""